@startuml
title Rundler — three tasks, one binary or three processes
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4A78B5

[Client] as Client

package "rundler" {
  [RPC\neth_ debug_ rundler_ admin_] as RPC
  [Pool\nmempool per entry point] as Pool
  [Builder\nAssigner + N workers] as Builder
}

[EVM node\nJSON-RPC] as Node
[EntryPoint\nv0.6 - v0.9] as EP

Client --> RPC : eth_sendUserOperation
RPC --> Pool : add_operation
RPC --> Builder : debug_ only\nbundling mode, send now
Pool --> Builder : new-block stream\nbest operations
Builder --> Pool : remove failed ops
Pool --> Node : debug_traceCall\nchain polling
Builder --> Node : eth_call\neth_sendRawTransaction
Node --> EP : handleOps

note bottom of Builder
  Pool and Builder each run a server.
  In-memory channels in `node` mode,
  gRPC when run as separate processes.
end note
@enduml
